From 98bc966c3ec4a314a3a41ff17968cd8bbba4c789 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: elk-engine-oracle <oracle@invalid>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 19:12:00 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] alg.test: pluggable label text measurer

TestConfiguration.computeLabelSize sizes unsized labels with AWT font
metrics, so the test framework's layouts depend on the platform's
fonts. The measurement moves behind a TextMeasurer, selected by the
system property org.eclipse.elk.alg.test.textMeasurer: unset or "awt"
keeps ELK's behavior (AwtTextMeasurer, the former body unchanged),
"fixed" measures [length * 6, 12] (FixedAdvanceTextMeasurer), any other
value throws. Paired TS seam: test/helpers/layout-test-text-measurer.ts
in the elk-engine port.
